00:08:57.020 --> 00:08:59.000
leaving vapor pockets at the feed lines.

00:08:59.740 --> 00:09:02.280
Without active settling thrust or a dedicated

00:09:02.280 --> 00:09:05.740
alleged motor, the turbopumps risk ingesting gas

00:09:05.740 --> 00:09:07.520
and cavitating on ignition.

00:09:08.400 --> 00:09:12.640
SpaceX's approach uses a short RCS burn to settle the propellants,

00:09:13.140 --> 00:09:15.740
followed by a carefully timed helium purge

00:09:15.740 --> 00:09:18.240
that clears the lines before the igniter fires.

00:09:18.760 --> 00:09:22.140
