settling system or a redesign of the tank geometry,

00:09:54.820 --> 00:09:59.240
both of which multiply the per flight cost far beyond the price of the fuel.

00:09:59.960 --> 00:10:02.140
The idiot index here is instructive

00:10:02.140 --> 00:10:04.340
because the finished capability of reliable

00:10:04.340 --> 00:10:07.640
vacuum restart costs orders of magnitude more

00:10:07.640 --> 00:10:09.360
than the propellant inputs alone.

00:10:10.160 --> 00:10:13.520
Success on flight 13 would validate the settling sequence

00:10:13.520 --> 00:10:16.560
